s://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/1569e00c25b6f2b6d033800f0a07519f.mp4?t=1764297901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>HEXAROMA</strong>, the charming world of our island village builder! Dive into a relaxing yet challenging experience where puzzle and strategy meet city building. Set across beautiful hexagonal maps, this game lets you craft quaint villages amidst varied landscapes like snowy tundras, scorching deserts, lush steppes, towering mountains, and dense forests. As my first game, I am incredibly excited to share this cozy adventure with you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/1d4ad0625104285b5e42ca52f5ee3c46.poster.avif?t=1764297901\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/1d4ad0625104285b5e42ca52f5ee3c46.webm?t=1764297901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/1d4ad0625104285b5e42ca52f5ee3c46.mp4?t=1764297901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Why should you play this game? </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you're looking for a soothing yet engaging pastime, this is the perfect game for you. It\u2019s designed to be a chill and wholesome escape, allowing you to unwind as you create adorable island communities. Whether you're a seasoned gamer or just looking for a relaxing way to pass the time, the delightful atmosphere and simple mechanics make it easy to pick up and enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steam