trong>CROSS-PLATFORM CLOUD SAVE</strong>, <strong>GAMEPAD SUPPORT</strong>, and even <strong>runs smoothly on the Steam Deck</strong>. It\u2019s not just a game\u2014it\u2019s a little haven of creativity and strategy you can take anywhere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/8db7d69baa2fd0f8de3a3bfc276546a2.poster.avif?t=1764297901\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/8db7d69baa2fd0f8de3a3bfc276546a2.webm?t=1764297901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/8db7d69baa2fd0f8de3a3bfc276546a2.mp4?t=1764297901\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to embark on a relaxing journey of village building, where every decision shapes your own little world. I can't wait for you to experience the joy and tranquility this game offers. Happy building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please remember, this is a small game and developed by a single person\ud83d\ude42</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/8c617c64e671c624784a6e344af485c1.poster.avif?t=1764297901\" width=800 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/8c617c64e671c624784a6e344af485c1.webm?t=1764297901\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3056580/extras/8c617c64e671c624784a6e344af485c1.mp4?t=17